\multicolumn{3}{@{}l}{\scriptsize A bar drawn from zero would give C a visible
length; drawn from}\\
\multicolumn{3}{@{}l}{\scriptsize chance (0.0900) it correctly shows nothing.}\\[8pt]
\multicolumn{3}{@{}l}{\textbf{(b) Where the 0.7269 of above-chance skill goes}}\\[3pt]
binding      & \mrrbar{0.715}{80} & 71.5\,\% \\
